      "text": [
        " إِذَا قَتَلَ الرَّجُلُ الرَّجُلَيْنِ أَوْ أَكْثَرَ مِنْ ذَلِكَ قُتِلَ بِهِمْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from Muhammad Bin Isa, from Yunus, from Ibn Muskan, from the one who mentioned it, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘When the man kills two men or more than that, he would be killed by them (guardians of the deceased)’."
        ]
      }
